+recolour, rebuild with `build/build.sh` and eyeball the cover and back cover
+in the PDF before treating `dist/` as deliverable. Verified for the #1245
+recolour: cover rule/eyebrow/panel border and back-cover eyebrow/labels/panel
+border use the new tokens, not the retired `#ef8b39` / `#f2a865`.
