+## Palette history
+
+`prompt-library.json` still uses `palette.rocket_orange: "#ef8b39"` and the
+locked `style_suffix` text that embeds "rocket orange (#ef8b39)". That is
+intentional: the file is the generation record for the existing session-image
+catalog, not a live brand token.
+
+ATA brand accent for *new* mark work is `#b93800` (see
+`public/brand/allthingsai-favicon.svg`). Do **not** rewrite the 200 prompts
+retroactively to that colour — catalog validation requires every prompt to end
+with the locked `style_suffix`, so a palette edit forces a mass rewrite that
+would describe imagery never produced from those prompts. A future `#b93800`
+catalog (versioned or regenerated alongside new assets) is separate work when
+a regeneration wave is planned (#1245 freeze decision).
